    "The devlog reports a title screen with falling snow and a logo. Neither is verified: the image shows mountains, not a jumping gnome. The video’s title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny, not this game; playback was not inspected."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "What can anyone open to test the jump and first level?",
    "What level-building time remains after Bo’s reported reduction, and how does Bo relate to the listed team?",
    "Can Mia confirm programming time for the remaining two sprints?"
  ],
  "direction": {
