      "value": "stalled",
      "why": "The prototype-devlog requirement is already marked complete, but this sprint verifies neither the working core nor a chosen style."
    }
  },
  "lenses": {
    "marketing": "Devlog #2 told readers about the title screen and logo, receiving 0 applause and 0 views; no store page or playable link is listed.",
    "team": "About 20–30 stated hours remain, with only Alex confirming work this sprint; Mia’s missing confirmation makes programming capacity less certain. Bo’s reported reduction leaves level-building capacity unclear, and the search mentioned in the devlog has no open position listed.",
    "management": "Across two sprints, the closed reference tasks have not led to a verified playable build, and this sprint closed nothing. With 20–30 stated hours left and no effort estimates, fit remains unproven: cut the trailer storyboard from this checkpoint and keep the remaining scope to the playable jump and first level."
  }
